	(text "Four 3.3 V GPIO (MCU pins): 330R series + BAT54S clamp, ESD protection only (not 24 V tolerant).\nTwo differential analog inputs, about +-116 V per input, 10 Mohm per input: each leg 10M / 130k to VMID,\n0.1 uF across 130k (fc ~ 12 Hz), BAT54S clamp; the PIC32 ADC reads both legs and firmware subtracts.\nVMID = 1.65 V: R60/R61 divider into OA5 IN+ (pin 33), OA5 follower output on pin 46 (= AN25)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 25.4 0)
		(effects
